  app-icon shortcut (Material "chat"). Rendered inside the adaptive
  shortcut icon (mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_shortcut_new_chat). Filled with a
  fixed @color/shortcut_icon_fg (light/dark variants) instead of a theme
  attribute — shortcut icons are drawn by the launcher process, which
  doesn't resolve the app's ?attr tints, so the prior
  ?android:attr/colorControlNormal tint rendered the glyph invisible.
-->
